    <string name="info_text">This is a control unit with an ESP32 microprocessor that manages a small wastewater treatment plant. It is powered by 24 V AC. The DC/DC converter used is the LM2596, which provides a 3.3V DC power supply for the processor and other components. USB is implemented with an FT232 chip, and the RTC is powered by an MCP79410 with a CR2032 battery. The control unit has 4 inputs and 4 outputs. Temperature measurement is designed using the DS18B20 sensor connected to the Thermo input. Level measurement is implemented using the EARU pressure sensor. The device is connected via WiFi to a home network, allowing it to be controlled remotely.</string>
